# Profiler captures and compiled experiment harnesses.
#
# WP4 Phase 2 produced 80 MB of these under experiments/wp4_potrf/phase2_bench/
# alone. They are OUTPUTS of the scripts committed beside them -- rebuildable by
# running build.sh, re-capturable by re-running the profiler -- and nothing in
# the tree references them. An earlier PR on this branch reached 292,767
# additions the same way and had to be un-tracked; the READMEs and CSVs are the
# durable record, the blobs are not.
*.nsys-rep
*.sqlite
*.qdrep
experiments/**/nsys/
